### Create OWNER grant
POST http://localhost:8084/api/access-grants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "userId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "environment": "dev",
  "role": "OWNER"
}


### Create VIEWER grant
POST http://localhost:8084/api/access-grants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "userId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "environment": "dev",
  "role": "VIEWER"
}


### Find grants by project
GET http://localhost:8084/api/access-grants/projects/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111


### Check OWNER can read secret
POST http://localhost:8084/internal/access-checks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "userId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "environment": "dev",
  "action": "SECRET_READ"
}


### Check VIEWER can delete secret - should be false
POST http://localhost:8084/internal/access-checks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "userId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "environment": "dev",
  "action": "SECRET_DELETE"
}